    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d265-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d265-f1-content">
                <p>Circulates copy of a memorandum from Gen. Lemnitzer to McNamara on “Nuclear
                    Superiority of the US vis-a-vis the Soviet Union” for their information. Top
                    Secret/Restricted Data. 12 pp. National Archives and Records Administration, RG
                    218, JCS Records, JMF 2210.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
